  "analysis": "Both responses address the constraints (no DB rollback, ignore flaky network metric, cost‑aware polling, 10‑minute timeout). QHS proposes a simple once‑per‑minute poll, integrates the logic directly into the CI pipeline, and includes safeguards against false positives without adding extra manual toggles. VFH adds a feature‑flag rollout and a mandatory manual enable step, which introduces unnecessary friction and could delay the intended automatic rollback. Overall QHS aligns more closely with the requester’s need for an immediate, fully automated rollback mechanism.",
